{"id":"ef8b9840de4b4bc2","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-relative-complement-closed-class.md","title":"ZFC Relative Complement Closed Class","display":"df-zfc-relative-complement-closed-class — ZFC Relative Complement Closed Class","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-relative-complement-closed-class","aliases":["58-df-zfc-relative-complement-closed-class"],"display":"df-zfc-relative-complement-closed-class — ZFC Relative Complement Closed Class","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-setop-set-difference.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-relative-complement-closed-class"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-relative-complement-closed-class</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-relative-complement-closed-class — ZFC Relative Complement Closed Class"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"90335d0f6a9bc60f\" href=\"?note=90335d0f6a9bc60f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-zfc-setop-set-difference.md\">../batch07/58-df-zfc-setop-set-difference.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in V\">\\(C\\in V\\)</span> (set-coded family)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y,D\\in V\">\\(x,y,D\\in V\\)</span> (members and their relative complement)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSetopSetDifference}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSetopSetDifference}_S\\)</span> (set-difference graph predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"90335d0f6a9bc60f\" href=\"?note=90335d0f6a9bc60f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-zfc-setop-set-difference.md\">../batch07/58-df-zfc-setop-set-difference.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RelativeComplementClosedClass}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{RelativeComplementClosedClass}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}relative\\text{-}complement\\text{-}closed\\text{-}class} \\vdash \\mathrm{RelativeComplementClosedClass}_S(C) \\leftrightarrow \\forall x\\in C\\;\\forall y\\in C\\;\\exists D\\in C\\;\\mathrm{ZfcSetopSetDifference}_S(D,x,y)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}relative\\text{-}complement\\text{-}closed\\text{-}class} \\vdash \\mathrm{RelativeComplementClosedClass}_S(C) \\leftrightarrow \\forall x\\in C\\;\\forall y\\in C\\;\\exists D\\in C\\;\\mathrm{ZfcSetopSetDifference}_S(D,x,y)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Here “class” means a set-coded family, as required for a first-order ZFC atom. The graph predicate makes the relative-complement operation explicit and functional by extensionality.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-zfc-setop-set-difference.md","status":"resolved","id":"90335d0f6a9bc60f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-setop-set-difference.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-zfc-setop-set-difference.md","status":"resolved","id":"90335d0f6a9bc60f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcSetopSetDifference}_S$ (set-difference graph predicate, see [[../batch07/58-df-zfc-setop-set-difference.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"C\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"x,y,D\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSetopSetDifference}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RelativeComplementClosedClass}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}relative\\text{-}complement\\text{-}closed\\text{-}class} \\vdash \\mathrm{RelativeComplementClosedClass}_S(C) \\leftrightarrow \\forall x\\in C\\;\\forall y\\in C\\;\\exists D\\in C\\;\\mathrm{ZfcSetopSetDifference}_S(D,x,y)","display":true}],"bytes":1215,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3328","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-relative-complement-closed-class.md|58-df-zfc-relative-complement-closed-class]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","90335d0f6a9bc60f"]}